    "title": "Clarendon County administration responds to pushback on proposed data center - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Elizabeth West ,\n7 hours ago CLARENDON COUNTY, S.C. (WIS) - Clarendon County leaders took to social media Wednesday to address concerns and questions about a proposed data center for the area. The county said that while plans for a data center are not official, Santee Electric has entered a contract with a data center to potentially secure a building at the Ram Bay Industrial Park. Read full article",
